    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GFIN — LinkedIn Reply & Acceptance Handler (Workflow C)\n\n**What this does:**\nTwo webhooks from Unipile:\n1. `new_relation` — fires when someone accepts an invite → sends follow-up DM (Damu's message)\n2. `message_received` — fires when anyone replies → drafts response with AI + emails Damu\n\n**Handles both:**\n- Invite acceptances (then post-accept follow-up DM)\n- Replies to invite notes\n- Replies to 1st-degree DMs\n\n**Setup steps:**\n1. Attach Unipile Header Auth to Send Follow-up DM node + set account_id\n2. Attach Google Sheets credential on all 4 sheet nodes\n3. Attach Gmail credential on Email node\n4. Attach OpenRouter credential on AI Draft Reply\n5. REGISTER webhooks in Unipile pointing at both webhook URLs (see production URLs below after saving)\n6. Add sheet columns: connected_at, reply_text, suggested_reply, replied_at\n\n**Notification destination:** demodamu@gmail.com",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ba8df477-b28e-42b7-84ea-f50bbc80103a",
      "name": "README",
