    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Lead name: {{ $json.name }}\nLead headline: {{ $json.headline }}\nLead org: {{ $json.slice }}\n\nWhat they said:\n\"{{ $('Parse Reply').item.json.reply_text }}\"\n\nContext: GoFundItNow is a grant/funding discovery service. They received an invite from Damu Winston mentioning a Thursday 8:30am EST demo, with the ask being for their business email to send the calendar invite.\n\nDraft a short reply (under 300 chars) that Damu can send back. Be:\n- Warm, direct, no fake enthusiasm\n- If they asked a question, answer it\n- If they showed interest, push toward getting their email or getting on the demo\n- If they were dismissive, gracefully accept and leave door open\n- If they asked what GoFundItNow is, give a 1-sentence explanation and reiterate the demo offer\n\nOutput STRICT JSON only, no markdown:\n{\n  \"suggested_reply\": \"the draft response\",\n  \"reply_sentiment\": \"positive\" | \"neutral\" | \"negative\" | \"question\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You draft LinkedIn reply suggestions for Damu Winston. Always output valid JSON matching the requested schema. Never include markdown code fences. Keep replies under 300 characters."
        }
      },
